id=perfspoof-hyperos
name=Performance Spoof (HyperOS watchdog)
version=1.0
versionCode=1
author=JoyBoy / HyperOS port
description=Keeps com.antutu.ABenchMark alive on HyperOS. Re-applies the AppOps, doze whitelist, standby bucket and freezer exemptions, and restarts the performance service when HyperOS stops it. The app itself is installed separately.
